1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:01,820
Imagine accidentally

2
00:00:01,840 --> 00:00:04,000
entering a parallel universe.

3
00:00:04,080 --> 00:00:06,300
It all begins on an ordinary evening.

4
00:00:06,320 --> 00:00:07,700
You're coming home when you notice

5
00:00:07,720 --> 00:00:09,800
a strange door in the hallway.

6
00:00:09,820 --> 00:00:10,940
You're absolutely sure

7
00:00:10,960 --> 00:00:12,500
it wasn't there before.

8
00:00:12,520 --> 00:00:15,060
A blue light is shining from underneath it.

9
00:00:15,080 --> 00:00:16,080
You carefully open the

10
00:00:16,100 --> 00:00:18,020
door and see your bedroom.

11
00:00:18,080 --> 00:00:20,260
Everything looks exactly the same.

12
00:00:20,280 --> 00:00:22,840
The same walls, the same furniture.

13
00:00:22,860 --> 00:00:25,420
Even your phone is lying in the same place.

14
00:00:25,440 --> 00:00:27,300
You take a few steps forward.

15
00:00:27,320 --> 00:00:29,920
Suddenly, a loud noise echoes around you.

16
00:00:29,940 --> 00:00:32,440
Everything begins to distort.

17
00:00:32,480 --> 00:00:33,700
A bright flash of light

18
00:00:33,720 --> 00:00:35,540
and you fall to the floor.

19
00:00:35,560 --> 00:00:36,740
When you open your eyes,

20
00:00:36,760 --> 00:00:38,420
the door has disappeared.

21
00:00:38,440 --> 00:00:39,980
You leave the room and immediately

22
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:41,820
notice something strange.

23
00:00:41,840 --> 00:00:43,860
The pictures on the walls are different.

24
00:00:43,880 --> 00:00:44,920
Some objects are no

25
00:00:44,940 --> 00:00:46,400
longer where they belong.

26
00:00:46,420 --> 00:00:47,580
You decide to find out what's

27
00:00:47,600 --> 00:00:49,500
happening and go to your parents.

28
00:00:49,520 --> 00:00:50,700
But they look at you as if

29
00:00:50,720 --> 00:00:52,500
they've never seen you before.

30
00:00:52,520 --> 00:00:53,940
You run outside.

31
00:00:53,960 --> 00:00:55,160
The city looks familiar,

32
00:00:55,180 --> 00:00:57,000
but the store names are different.

33
00:00:57,020 --> 00:00:58,340
The house numbers have changed.

34
00:00:58,360 --> 00:00:59,800
And some buildings look

35
00:00:59,820 --> 00:01:01,580
completely unfamiliar.

36
00:01:01,700 --> 00:01:02,480
You take out your phone

37
00:01:02,500 --> 00:01:04,120
and open your photos.

38
00:01:04,160 --> 00:01:06,680
You're missing from every single picture.

39
00:01:06,700 --> 00:01:09,040
Suddenly, a new message arrives.

40
00:01:09,060 --> 00:01:11,080
The sender is your own phone number.

41
00:01:11,100 --> 00:01:12,640
You open it and read:

42
00:01:12,660 --> 00:01:13,840
“Don't try to come back.

43
00:01:13,860 --> 00:01:15,540
There's already a you here.”

44
00:01:15,560 --> 00:01:18,140
At that moment, you hear a voice behind you.

45
00:01:18,160 --> 00:01:20,060
You slowly turn around.

46
00:01:20,080 --> 00:01:21,120
Standing in front of you is

47
00:01:21,140 --> 00:01:23,600
someone who looks exactly like you.

48
00:01:23,620 --> 00:01:24,540
The same hair,

49
00:01:24,560 --> 00:01:26,460
the same clothes, the same face.

50
00:01:26,480 --> 00:01:29,180
He looks at you calmly and says:

51
00:01:29,280 --> 00:01:30,660
“You're finally here.

52
00:01:30,680 --> 00:01:32,480
Now it's my turn to go home.”

53
00:01:32,500 --> 00:01:34,260
And that's when you realize:

54
00:01:34,340 --> 00:01:35,240
Maybe you didn't simply

55
00:01:35,260 --> 00:01:37,000
enter another universe.

56
00:01:37,120 --> 00:01:38,360
Maybe someone deliberately

57
00:01:38,380 --> 00:01:40,080
switched places with you.

58
00:01:40,100 --> 00:01:42,240
But which one of you is the real one?

59
00:01:42,260 --> 00:01:43,980
And most importantly, if you were in

60
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:46,420
his place, would you try to return home?

61
00:01:46,420 --> 00:01:51,620
Would you return to your world or stay here?
